  m_text: "At each stop, you collect an object and also receive a seed.\nYour current
    progress in the tour is displayed in the top right corner as a small seed icon.\nYou
    can access your objects at any time in the menu under \u2018Object Collection\u2019.\nOnce
    you have collected all 11 seeds, a secret stop will be unlocked!"
