  m_text: "In the map view, you will find all 11 stops of the tour as well as your
    current position.\_\nUse the \u2018Start navigation\u2019 button to display the
    route to a stop.\nWhen you get close to a stop, the app will notify you with
    a message: \u2018Stop reached!\u2019.\nFind and scan the marker on the floor
    to start the augmented reality."
